\newlabel{fig:og_cel_frac_curves}{{8}{13}{Mean performance and mean hyperparameter CV as a function of negative sign percentage for the anatomical \textit {C.\ elegans} contact-count magnitude pattern after removing connections with unknown or complex signs. IPC is denoted in orange, GR in red, MC in blue, and KR in green. Reintroducing inhibitory signs again traces the performance--invariance tradeoff, now with contact-count magnitudes held in place. A total of 50 trials were performed for each fraction}{figure.8}{}}
